OL,3,ARussell Brand tells court allegations
OL,4,Ahad devastating impact on him
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe allegations, made by six female
OL,7,Fcomplainants, span a 10-year period
OL,8,Fbetween 1999 and 2009. He denies all
OL,9,Fthe charges.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
