OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHealey pictured with iconic red box as
OL,4,Ahe leaves Downing Street ahead of
OL,5,ABudget
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe move - due to take effect next year
OL,8,F"or as soon as possible" - will save
OL,9,F60% of households an average of #45 per
OL,10,Fyear, according to the Treasury
OL,12,FThe government has promised a plan that
OL,13,F"moves money and power out of
OL,14,FWestminster", but ministers face
OL,15,Fpressure on the cost of living and
OL,16,Fgovernment borrowing
OL,18,FAhead of this first Budget of Andy
OL,19,FBurnham's premiership, our political
OL,20,Fcorrespondent says opposition parties
OL,21,Fhave criticised what they see as
OL,22,Flimited scale and ambition
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
