OL,3,AMore than half of Israeli votes counted
OL,4,Aas Netanyahu and Eisenkot both set to
OL,5,Afall short of majority
OL,6,
OL,7,FWith more than 70% of votes counted,
OL,8,Fneither of the two main blocs are on
OL,9,Ftrack for a majority
OL,11,FEisenkot leads the newly formed Yashar
OL,12,Fparty and is the main figure in the
OL,13,F"change bloc". Results suggest
OL,14,FNetanyahu's Likud is set to be the
OL,15,Fbiggest single party
OL,17,FNetanyahu calls for a "strong"
OL,18,Fright-wing government, Eisenkot insists
OL,19,FIsrael voted to end Netanyahu's term
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
