OL,3,AMore than half of Israeli votes counted
OL,4,Aas Netanyahu and Eisenkot both set to
OL,5,Afall short of majority
OL,6,
OL,7,FAll 120 seats in the Knesset, Israel's
OL,8,Fparliament, are up for grabs, but no
OL,9,Fparty has ever won a majority and in
OL,10,Fthe past governments have been made up
OL,11,Fof coalitions
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
